When the user asks to roast, review, critique, audit, or score a design (UI/UX flow, fonts, responsive, duplicate info, animation, posters, banners, video), read `skills/design-roast/SKILL.md` and follow it. Trigger it selectively, not for every code edit. If a feature-specific rule attachment is supported, use it; otherwise attach this rule manually.
